#!/bin/bash
# Brings the bar back after qs-quit unloaded it. Mirrors the bootstrap +
# kickstart dance startup.sh already does for a fresh start: bootstrap only
# registers the job, it does not actually run it, so kickstart is required
# even right after a bootstrap.
set -uo pipefail
GUI="gui/$(id -u)"
PLIST="$HOME/Library/LaunchAgents/org.quickshell.bar.plist"
launchctl print "$GUI/org.quickshell.bar" >/dev/null 2>&1 || launchctl bootstrap "$GUI" "$PLIST"
launchctl kickstart -k "$GUI/org.quickshell.bar"

# Reserve the strip qs-quit gave back. Height must match yabairc's own
# `external_bar all:40:0` -- there is no single source of truth for it, so a
# bar height change has to update both.
command -v yabai >/dev/null 2>&1 && yabai -m config external_bar all:40:0 >/dev/null 2>&1
